WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.890
For a passed bike check, start by matching the original ticket number and the reported pedal noise.

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:13.480
Only after the same unit has been tested should you select No recurrence; if the bike is unavailable, leave the check open.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:19.370
Verify the outcome on the check and open the original schedule to distinguish this result from a future appointment.
